**users/kasiro.nix**: add `linger = true;`

**Package variant**: default module package = packages.default (full, ~700MB closure). Option: override to messaging (~33MB) via `services.hermes-agent.package = inputs.hermes-agent.packages.${pkgs.system}.messaging;` — but caution: full includes provider groups (anthropic, bedrock...). Actually those dependency groups are for provider SDKs; minimal may lazy-install which fails on NixOS read-only store? Uncertain — the docs said runtime deps are wrapped. Keep default (full) as safe default; mention messaging as lighter option.

